# RockxyBase — public distribution repository
#
# This repository is public. It carries the release feed, release notes, the policies and
# the issue templates — and nothing else. RockxyBase is proprietary: its source code, plans,
# research, agent and AI tooling, build output, signing material and credentials live in
# the private source repository and must never land here.
#
# So this file is an allowlist. Everything is ignored, and only the files below are let
# back in. A new public file is added here on purpose, after reading it; anything copied
# into this folder by accident (a source tree, a plan, an agent file, a key) stays out
# of every commit without anyone having to remember a pattern for it.

# 1. Ignore everything, at every depth.
/*
/.*

# 2. The public files, by name.
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/LICENSE
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/SUPPORT.md
!/appcast.xml

# 3. GitHub configuration: issue forms and the contact links only. No workflows: this
#    repository runs no automation and holds no tokens.
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml

# 4. Screenshots shown in the README, if any are published. PNG and JPEG only.
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/images/
/docs/images/*
!/docs/images/*.png
!/docs/images/*.jpg

# 5. Never, even inside an allowed folder — belt and braces for the rules above.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swift
**/*.xcodeproj
**/*.xcworkspace
**/*.xcconfig
**/*.entitlements
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.cer
**/*.mobileprovision
**/*.dmg
**/*.zip
**/.env*
**/.claude/
**/.codex/
**/.agents/
**/.cursor/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/GEMINI.md
